  "description": "#5364 — a journal day leaves the template's `<% recording %>` block out and keeps its children in its place, as `/template` does: a day has no recording to put there, and a literal placeholder in every new day is noise. The placeholder reads in any case and with spaces inside the delimiters (`is_recording_placeholder`), the same matcher `/meeting` uses to find where a meeting's recording goes. Its child takes its place at the top level, and that child's own child stays under it. What the mock approximates is the same as `journal_template_day`'s: content and nesting only.",
